OL,3,GNEWSAElderly woman dies in bus
OL,4,Acollision on high street
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman in her 70s has been killed in a
OL,7,Fcollision with a bus on a busy high
OL,8,Fstreet.
OL,10,FAvon and Somerset Police are
OL,11,Finvestigating the collision that took
OL,12,Fplace just before 13:20 BST on Regent
OL,13,FStreet in Kingswood.
OL,15,FPolice said the woman was pronounced
OL,16,Fdead at the scene and her next of kin
OL,17,Fhave been informed.
OL,19,FRegent Street remains closed while
OL,20,Finquiries continue, with a cordon in
OL,21,Fplace outside the Kings Chase Shopping
OL,22,FCentre.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
